# Campus fee & fund generation (implementation)

**Start with `campus-fee-domain.mdc`** for contracts. Open this file only when editing the globs above or `SPstudentfee` behavior.

## Tuition (`FundTypeID = 1`)

- All: `EXEC SPstudentfee` — 180s timeout; log `FeeGenerateAll`.
- Single upsert: charge row where `(Recieved ?? 0) == 0` and `(Discount ?? 0) == 0` for same student/month/year.
- `amount === -1` → `Student.TutionFee`.

## Annual funds (2–5)

- Upsert match: `Payment > 0` OR `(Payment ?? 0) + (Recieved ?? 0) == 0`; `Month = 0`.
